  abilityDesc: 21 combo Thunder attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), 100% damage reduction for 4 turns, boosts Thunder elemental damage for 4
    turns, damage taken fills BB gauge for 4 turns, fills OD gauge at turn's end
    for 4 turns & boosts max HP
